        "TileImage": "$($repository bbd196c0-3354-441c-aa64-9180ac335d9f).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning 47, i have the most important mission for you today with three targets that are enemies most dire. The annual flower power show is happening and I&apos;ve entered myself. Fancy myself a garderner now, I guess. This brings us to todays mission. the Three secret judges are people who dont like me. Every rose has its thornes no doubt. Take care of it 47, I need to win the annual flower power show",
